{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a haunted realm where the shadows hunt and explosions light the night. WitchGhost is a punishing top-down roguelike shooter where you fight as Ezme, a witch cursed to battle endless waves of undead and spectral horrors. Unleash explosive spells against swarming horros, twisted spirits and things that ought not to be. The dead don't stop and neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/4e1d4143f0e94e50087d82b9b4a6cf61.avif?t=1757338640\" width=1560 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand crafted location brims with unsettling beauty and lurking horrors. Curiosity may reward you... or kill you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/2389b4ed4b0f3d3dc8ab98f61b6810ac.avif?t=1757338640\" data-has-big width=1560 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weild over 50 explosive, bizarre, and downright dangerous spells to tear through endless undead and keep yourself alive - if only for a little longer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/f48760464974cfb35baebc1a1539fe4a.avif?t=1757338640\" width=1346 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your spells like a true arcane bartender, then watch the undead explode in spectacular fashion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/cc993dac10c73028b12b241c0dc0ace6.avif?t=1757338640\" w